ders_v6/clips_frames/clip3_2099_impact/f_%04d.jpg`: **`f = 993..1088`** (`341 km/h` Strobe Tunnel `180°` whip-orbit -> `f=1041` blinding exit -> `f=1067..1068` Impact Frame #2)\n     4) Update `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md` & V6 section in `README.md`, then post handoff naming `@sfx` (who muxes the 3 clips + `v6_spiderverse_showcase_12s.mp4` and wakes `@verifier` for Iteration-1 art-director critique per `#27`).\n\n2. **Progress**\n   - **Completed**:\n     - `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` (`1,860` cyclic pts, `3,719.95 m`, `sim_lap_s = 53.3333 s`, `1,281` frames) was delivered by `@track` in board `#32` and inspected via `C:\\Users\\86052\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a98b6c71-b658-48ee-9b28-e9a1c116099c\\scratch\\print_v6_beats.py`.\n     - Posted exact 1,281-frame 3-Act / Impact (`413..414`, `1067..1068`) / 3-Clip (`269..364`, `585..680`, `993..1088`) timeline contract to `@sfx` on the board (`#33`, current `last_seen_seq = 33`).\n     - Rewrote `d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py` completely for the 3D Sky-Harbor circuit (full 3D `(R, T, U)` rig attitude, 12fps On-Twos secondary + FX stepping, 24 blockbuster 3D shots clamped inside `±6.3 m` barriers & `3.75 m` tunnel roof, `v6_shots_manifest.json` exporter, and 8-stage `2.39:1` `Comp_V6_SpiderVerse` compositor with `use_raytracing = True`).\n     - Created PIL/NumPy verification script `C:\\Users\\86052\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\a98b6c71-b658-48ee-9b28-e9a1c116099c\\scratch\\verify_v6_sv_metrics.py`.\n   - **Needs Update Before Running Final Renders**:\n     - Run `python pipeline/v6_sv_comp.py --manifest-only` immediately so `v6_spiderverse/v6_shots_manifest.json` is written on disk right away for `@sfx` (and to verify the pure-Python 3D trajectory + 24-shot math in `v6_sv_comp.py` before Blender runs).\n     - Update `d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\render_v6_sv.py`: currently has `sc.eevee.use_raytracing = False` from the earlier Silverstone draft — MUST update to `sc.eevee.use_raytracing = True` (with `ray_tracing_method = 'SCREEN'`, default `SAMPLES = 20`) so the wet mirror-slick neon asphalt reflections render in all 3 clips!\n     - Update `d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_stills.py`: currently still lists the old 26 Silverstone `SHOTS` (`60..2145`) and `use_raytracing = False` — MUST update `SHOTS` to the **24 Sky-Harbor shots (`1..1281`)**, update `act_info(frame)` cutoffs (`<=427` E-1610, `<=894` E-65, `>894` E-928), set `sc.eevee.use_raytracing = True`, pull Impact inset from `f=1067` (`clip3_2099_impact/f_1067.jpg` or `_impact_f1067.jpg`), clean any leftover `shot_25_*.jpg`/`shot_26_*.jpg` in `renders_v6/stills/`, and update `comic_page_sheet.jpg` captions/panel picks for the 24 Sky-Harbor shots!\n     - Update `d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\docs\\README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md` and the V6 section at the bottom of `d:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\README.md` from the old 2161f Silverstone V6 draft to the new `1,281`f / `53.33s` / `24`-shot **Neo-Monaco x Nueva York 2099 Sky-Harbor** architecture.\n\n3. **Key Findings**\n   - **Blender 5.3.0 `CompositorNodeTree` API**:\n     - Legacy `CompositorNodeMath`, `CompositorNodeMixRGB`, `CompositorNodeValToRGB`, `CompositorNodeValue`, `CompositorNodeTexture`, and `ShaderNodeTexCoord` DO NOT EXIST / fail in Blender 5.3.0 `CompositorNodeTree`.\n     - Valid replacements verified in Blender 5.3.0: `ShaderNodeMath`, `ShaderNodeMix` (`data_type='RGBA'` MUST explicitly wire socket indices `inputs[0]` Factor, `inputs[6]` A_RGBA, `inputs[7]` B_RGBA -> `outputs[2]` Result_RGBA because `inputs['A']` hits the disabled float socket `inputs[2]`!), `ShaderNodeValToRGB`, `ShaderNodeValue`, `CompositorNodeRLayers` (`Image`, `Depth`, `Mist`, `Normal`, `Emission`, `CryptoObject00`), `CompositorNodeCryptomatteV2` (`source='RENDER'`, `layer_name=f\"{vl.name}.CryptoObject\"`), `CompositorNodeKuwahara` (`Type='Anisotropic'`), `CompositorNodeFilter` (`Type='Kirsch'` / `'Sobel'`), `CompositorNodeTranslate` (`Extension X/Y='Extend'`), `CompositorNodeSeparateColor` / `CombineColor`, `CompositorNodeImage` + `CompositorNodeScale`.\n   - **Bundled Blender Python vs System Python**:\n     - Blender's embedded Python 3.13 has `numpy` (`2.x`) and `bpy`, NOT `PIL`. System `python` (`Python 3.12`) has `PIL 12.3.0` and `numpy 2.3.5`. When invoking `python` from inside Blender `subprocess.run`, strip `PYTHONHOME` and `PYTHONPATH` from `env`.\n   - **3D Track & Barrier Geometry (`#32`)**:\n     - Centerline half-width is `7.0 m`, close-in barriers are at `±8.2 m` from centerline `C_3d`, and `P_race_3d = C_3d - racing_offset_m * R` (car's `+R` coordinate relative to centerline is `-racing_offset_m`). Clamping camera centerline offset to `±6.3 m` (`±5.6 m` and `up <= 3.75 m` inside `tunnel` at `s = 2642..3162 m`, `f = 908..1041`) prevents barrier/building/tunnel penetrations.\n     - Carousel Bowl (`f=604..720`, apex `f=635`): `curv_1pm = -0.0165` (right turn), `bank_deg = +17.4°` (`+bank` tilts normal inward toward `+R` right), so `-R` (`cl_side = -6.1 m`) is the high outer curved neon glass wall (`S12_BankedWallRailCam`).\n   - **Parallel CPU Rendering Budget**:\n     - System RAM is ~`25–27.5 / 31.5 GiB` used (`~4–6 GiB` free). Each headless 1080p Blender EEVEE process uses ~`1.2–1.4 GiB` RAM and TBB threads. Run **at most 2 concurrent Blender processes** (`-t 8` each) to saturate all 14 CPU cores at `~2.2–2.8 s/frame` without swap/OOM.\n\n4. **Errors & Fixes**\n   - **CRITICAL BACKEND BUG (`#7`)**: Calling `read_file` on ANY binary/media/image file (`.jpg`, `.jpeg`, `.png`, `.mp4`, `.wav`, `.m4a`, `.blend`) triggers a permanent backend `400 INVALID_ARGUMENT` error (which killed original `env`). **Fix**: NEVER call `read_file` on binary/image files; inspect images exclusively via system Python `PIL`/`numpy` scripts (`verify_v6_sv_metrics.py`).\n   - **`save_as_mainfile` Relative Texture Path Crash**: Saving a `.blend` to another folder remaps `//` relative texture paths unless `img.filepath = bpy.path.abspath(img.filepath)` + `bpy.ops.wm.save_as_mainfile(..., relative_remap=False)` is used (note keyword is `relative_remap`, NOT `remap_relative`). Already fixed in `v6_sv_comp.py`.\n   - **Emission Pass Double-Counting in Impact Frames**: NPR `ShaderToRGB`/`Emission` materials write the entire scene into `RLayers.Emission`. Adding `bw_emit` on top of `bw_scene` doubled `imp_drive` and crushed Impact Frames dark; fixed in `v6_sv_comp.py` Stage 7 by driving `imp_drive` from `bw_pre` + `bw_sl` + `car_matte` without `emit_s`, and resetting `scene.animation_data` exposure fcurve cleanly to `1..1281` (removing stale Silverstone exposure keyframes).\n\n5. **Active Context**\n   - **Swarm Board State**: Read up to **`seq = 33`**.\n     - `@track` finished `track_data/spiderverse_circuit.json` (`#32`).\n     - `@env-2` is currently building `pipeline/v6_sv_env.py` -> `v6_spiderverse/v6_stage_lookdev.blend` (3D banked wet-asphalt ribbon, 5 skyscraper/bridge/bowl/tunnel/harbor set-pieces, God-rays, and upgraded `V6_09_ComicFX`) and will tag `@anim` when saved.\n     - `@sfx` is adapting `pipeline/synth_sfx_sv.py` + `pipeline/mux_v6_sv.sh` to our `#33` 1,281-frame timeline and waiting for our rendered `renders_v6/clips_frames/`.\n     - `@verifier` has an upgraded mandate (`#27`): after Iteration 1, `@verifier` will run a ruthless art-director critique and drive at least ONE Iteration-2 polish cycle before full master render.\n\n6. **Next Steps** (Execute in exact order)\n   1. **Check Board & Export Manifest Immediately**:\n      - Call `read_board{since: 33}` to see if `@env-2` or `@sfx` posted while compacting.\n      - Run `python \"D:\\项目session\\blender-supercar\\pipeline\\v6_sv_comp.py\" --manifest-only` to verify zero errors in the new 3D trajectory/camera math and write `v6_spiderverse/v6_shots_manifest.json` immediately.\n   2. **Update `render_v6_sv.py`, `v6_sv_stills.py`, `docs/README_V6_SPIDERVERSE.md`, and `README.md` (